      },
      {
        "id": "cym_s_for_eng:pod-0:SC07-S011",
        "order": 38,
        "text": "Alla i dalu gyda cherdyn? Oes contactless 'da chi?",
        "reason": "no atom_map, no whole-turn audio"
      },
      {
        "id": "cym_s_for_eng:pod-0:SC07-S012",
        "order": 39,
        "text": "Wrth gwrs. Dyma'r peiriant.",
        "reason": "no atom_map, no whole-turn audio"
      },
      {
        "id": "cym_s_for_eng:pod-0:SC07-S013",
        "order": 40,
        "text": "Bore da. Dau Americano a chwpaned o de, os gwelwch yn dda.",
